## 4️⃣ Quick checklist for the port

| ✅ Done | ❓ Still needed |
|--------|----------------|
| ✅ Add `RasterDemSource` with the same URL you used in the web style. | ❓ If you truly need 3-D terrain, you must wait for a native implementation or use a WebView. |
| ✅ Add a visual relief layer (`HillshadeLayer` or `ColorReliefLayer`). | ❓ Adjust the visual style (colors, illumination) to match your web map’s look. |
| ✅ Keep the rest of your style (vector sources, symbols, etc.) – they work unchanged. | ❓ If you have any `interpolate-hcl` / `interpolate-lab` expressions, make sure you are on at least `android-v13.7.1`. |
| ✅ Tested on Android 13 (MapLibre v13.7.1) – no crashes, layer appears. | ❓ None (unless you need terrain). |

